## ✨ Features

* User registration with Worker and Buyer roles
* Firebase Email/Password and Google authentication
* Worker and Buyer role-based dashboards
* Admin dashboard for platform management
* Buyers can create and manage tasks
* Workers can browse and complete available tasks
* Workers can submit task proof for review
* Buyers can approve or reject task submissions
* Coin-based earning and payment system
* Workers can request withdrawals
* Buyers can purchase coins
* Payment history for buyers
* Notification system for important activities
* Pagination for worker submissions
* Responsive design for mobile, tablet, and desktop
* Secure environment variables for sensitive credentials
* Role-based authorization for protected API routes
* Image uploading support for user/task images
* Task deletion and refund functionality
* Admin can manage users, roles, and tasks

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* React.js
* Node.js
* Express.js
* MongoDB
* Firebase Authentication
* Stripe
* ImgBB
* Tailwind CSS

